-- erwartet: Hinweis D023
-- **A quantifier whose body does not depend on its variable.**
--
-- The purest form of the same fault as `D022`, and the one shape no use-rule can reach --
-- because there is no use. `forall f in D : P` with `P` free of `f` says the same over one
-- element as over a million, and the same over `D` as over any other domain.
--
-- **A HINT and not a refusal, and the ground is measured.** The form is vacuous, not
-- inconsistent. And after `D022` neither `fields of` nor `threads` can say anything about a
-- declared carrier at all, so the vacuous body is the last writable form of two domains of
-- the nine: refusing it would be a grammar change wearing a rule's clothes, and that
-- grammar change is booked elsewhere (`messung/GRAMMATIK-VOLLSTAENDIG-2026-09-08.md` §2.3,
-- `PLAN.md` §9.1: *"a language change, not a model change"*).
module gift::binder_nie_genannt {

const N : u32 = 8;

table T count N {
    slot { a : u32 in 0 .. 10, }

    -- `s` is bound and never mentioned again.
    invariant erstes_feld_klein cost O(n) runs offline :
        forall s in slots of T : T.slots[0].a <= 10;
}

}
